# Backend Rules

- Stack: Django 6.1, DRF 3.18, PostgreSQL.
- All endpoints under `/api/` prefix.
- Use ViewSets + Routers for CRUD resources.
- No raw SQL — use ORM. Parameterised queries only if raw SQL is unavoidable.
- Migrations must be generated for every model change.
- `python manage.py check` must pass before any commit.
- Credentials via environment variables (python-decouple). Never hardcode secrets.
